  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-29T01:39:43.017Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This forum post (https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-28-july-2022/10346) announced that there are plans to introduce avatar hiding to improve performance. I like this feature, however, I propose a slight change to the idea:\nI would like it to hide a specific number of avatars, instead of just by distance.\n- It would scale with how spread out people are in the world. \n- Performance would be more consistent across worlds.\n- I think it would be relatively easy to implement (I think).\n- Making the user able to increase this number would have a similar effect as being able to increase the radius.\n(e.g. In a small club it would only show the closest 15 avatars. In a big open area it would also show the 15 closest avatars, except you would be able to see them far away and still keep performance).",
